                            <comment id="19464223" author="adepetri" created="Mon, 27 Apr 2026 17:18:58 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;Demo: &lt;span class=&quot;nobr&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/attachment/6804845/6804845_Screen+Recording+2026-04-27+at+11.14.23%E2%80%AFAM.mov&quot; title=&quot;Screen Recording 2026-04-27 at 11.14.23&#8239;AM.mov attached to JGVT-3610&quot;&gt;Screen Recording 2026-04-27 at 11.14.23&#8239;AM.mov&lt;sup&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;rendericon&quot; src=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif&quot; height=&quot;7&quot; width=&quot;7&quot; align=&quot;absmiddle&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; border=&quot;0&quot;/&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="19450564" author="adepetri" created="Fri, 24 Apr 2026 17:51:20 +0200"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.jnj.com/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=MGhysel1&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;MGhysel1&quot;&gt;Ghysels, Martine [JRDBE NON-J&amp;amp;J]&lt;/a&gt; Wanted to point out that the Actual Amt field can also be edited from the GxP Reason for Change Entry external action. That was developed to accept an negative value as that external action does not touch the Balance Data field.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
